","Stem hole borer (SB) is a major threat to coffee plants in many regions, particularly in the late-term and post-harvest stages. It is a complex issue with no single solution, so an integrated approach is essential for effective control. Here are some recommended methods to control shoot hole borer beetle infestations in coffee plants:

