   - **Targeting SH2 Domains**: By targeting SH2 domains, researchers can develop small-of-action molecules that block the interaction of SH2 domains with phosphotyrosine residues, thereby reducing the activation of intracellular signaling pathways that contribute to excitotoxic mechanisms.
