Calculate the standard enthalpy change for the reaction between [Fe(H2O)6]2+ and 2Cl- ions to produce [FeCl4]2- complex ion given that the enthalpy of formation for [FeCl4]2- is -392 kJ/mol and the enthalpies of hydration for Fe2+ and Cl- ions are -340 kJ/mol and -381 kJ/mol, respectively.<end_of_turn>
