\]

Where:
- \( E_g \) is the lattice energy
- \( \alpha_0 \) is the Born-Lande constant (\( 2.21 \times 10^{-19} \, \text{J nm}^3 \))
- \( r \) is the distance between the ions (0.211 nm)
- \( Z_1 \) and \( Z_2 \) are the charges of the ions (\( Z_1 = +2 \) for Ca²⁺ and \( Z_2 = -1 \) for Cl⁻).

