2. **Consider the set of fractions with a common denominator:** For each integer $b$, consider the set of fractions $a/b$ with $0 \leq a \leq b$ and $a/b \leq 1$. This set is $\left\{ \frac{a}{b} \mid 0 \leq a \leq b \text{ and } a \in \mathbb{Z} \right\}$.

