The multiples of 3 between 1 and 30 are 3, 6, 9, 12, 15, 18, 21, 24, 27, 30. There are 10 multiples of 3.
The multiples of 4 between 1 and 30 are 4, 8, 12, 16, 20, 24, 28. There are 7 multiples of 4.
The multiples of 12 between 1 and 30 are 12, 24. There are 2 multiples of 12.

The number of multiples of 3 or 4 is the sum of the number of multiples of 3 and the number of multiples of 4, minus the number of multiples of both 3 and 4 (i.e., multiples of 12).
\[
