Total amount = J + Jo + B
Total amount = Rs. 1600 (John) + Rs. 3200 (Jose) + Rs. 4800 (Binoy)
Total amount = Rs. 1600 + Rs. 3200 + Rs. 4800
Total amount = Rs. 9600

Therefore, the total amount of money shared among them is Rs. $\boxed{9600}$ .
