   \[
   v_{\text{Earth}} = -\frac{m_{\text{cannonball}}}{m_{\text{Earth}}} v_{\text{cannonball}}
   \]
   Substitute the given values:
   \[
   v_{\text{Earth}} = -\frac{1 \text{ kg}}{5.97 \times 10^{24} \text{ kg}} \times 90.0 \text{ m/s}
   \]
   \[
   v_{\text{Earth}} \approx -1.5 \times 10^{-22} \text{ m/s}
