   ΔG° = the standard free energy change
   R = the gas constant (8.314 J/mol·K)
   T = the temperature in Kelvin (37°C = 310 K)
   Q = the reaction quotient

   For the hydrolysis reaction (ATP → ADP + Pi), the reaction quotient (Q) is:

