   \]  
   Substituting the values:  
   \[
   S = 1 \times 8.314 \times \ln \left( \frac{1}{2414.1} \right) \approx 20.5 \, \text{J/K}
   \]  
   The entropy is \(\boxed{20.5 \, \text{J/K}}\).  

